    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><strong>Concept.</strong> When Allesh-Gilliam needs to move the whole HQ, it folds the repurposed S'narchy Burger into a self-propelled drive-thru. The order speaker still works. It will take your order whether you stop or not. PROUDLY OVERCOOKED SINCE THE SHATTERING.</p>\n<p><strong>Signature.</strong> A moving home town — the wrongness of the wastes falls quiet around it, and the coffee is, against all odds, fresh.</p>",
        "public": ""
      }
    },
